:: StoryTitle
Don't Join


:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "25E6977C-D2A1-4C7C-BAA9-3BDD73F4D7D2",
  "format": "Harlowe",
  "format-version": "3",
  "zoom": 0.6
}

:: Startup [startup] {"position":"800,0"}
(set: $hasEars to false)\
(set: $hasVoice to false)\
(set: $awareness to 0)

:: Start {"position":"800,200","size":"100,100"}
#Don't Join
|keywords>[Keywords] in the body will help you to explore the world. This could be |keywords>[investigating or interacting with objects] in the world.

(click: ?keywords)[|decisions>[Decisions] will appear at the bottom of the screen below the line, these decisions cannot be undone and will move on from the current scene.]
---
(click: ?decisions)[[[Power On->Creation]] to begin the story
]
\(click: ?investigating)[Investigating can reveal new choices and change the world state]


:: Creation {"position":"800,400","size":"100,100"}
A spark of electricity as you come to life, |lookAround>[you appear to be in a grey room...](click: ?lookAround)[(append: ?lookAround)[
  
  Looking around you further, you appear to be shackled to a chair.
  
  |hiddenRoom>[The room] is completely silent. It seems like you are still in the process of being built as you are unable to hear or speak.
  (click: ?hiddenRoom)[(set: $awareness to $awareness + 1)Looking further around the room you see a vent in the corner.]
  
  You can see two droids that appear to be arguing with each other.
The droid to your left is a silver droid that appears to be holding a |voiceBox>[voice-box unit]
The droid to your right is a bronze droid that appears to be holding an |earsBox>[auditory sensor array]]]
---
(click: ?voiceBox)[[[Point towards the silver droid with the Voice-Box Unit->Voice]]]
(click: ?earsBox)[[Point towards the bronze droid with the Auditory Sensor Array->Ears]]



:: Ears {"position":"700,600","size":"100,100"}
(set: $hasEars to true)
The bronze droid installs your auditory sensor array, a loud humming noise overwhelms your newly installed auditory sensors

They begin adjusting the sensors, as the calibration continues you can hear the humming fading into the background.

  "Can you hear me?" you hear the droid repeating, gradually becoming clearer.
  (if: $hasVoice)[
    [[Yes, I can hear you]]
  ]
  (else:)[
    [[Stare at the droid asking if you can hear->EarsStare]]
  ]

:: Yes, I can hear you {"position":"600, 700"}
"Oh good, you can hear me, perfect, now please |focus>[focus on your surroundings], what can you hear?"
  (click: ?focus)[
    You listen closely, hearing a small array of sounds:
    - |humming>["I can hear a low humming noise"](click: ?humming)[(replace: ?humming)[You can hear a low humming noise, focusing in on the noise you believe it to be the engine of the ship we're on.]]
    - |buzzing>["I can hear a buzzing noise behind the door"](click: ?buzzing)[(replace: ?buzzing)[    "Buzzing behind the door? Oh you mean the mouse droids, they're utility droids that help with navigation, cleaning and transporting data."]]
    - |ventRattle>["I can hear a rattling noise"](click: ?ventRattle)[(replace: ?ventRattle)[    "That rattling is just the |hiddenVent>[ventilation] fans."]]\
    (click: ?hiddenVent)[(set: $awareness to $awareness + 1)\
      Listening even closer, you can here that there is two distinct rattling noises, one from the fan spinning but another noise that sounds like something moving.
    ]
    - |silverDroid>[the silver droid laughing]
  ]
---
[["Are we done here?"]]

:: EarsStare {"position":"700, 700"}
"Can you hear me? Please say something" the bronze droid says with a worried voice.
The silver droid bursts out laughing and says "I'm still holding the voice-box you idiot."

"Oh... right... can you |nodHead>[nod your head] if you can hear me?"
  (click: ?nodHead)["Oh good, you can hear me, perfect, now please |focus>[focus on your surroundings], what can you hear?"]
  (click: ?focus)[
    As you listen closer to your surroundings you can hear feint |humming>[humming], |rattling>[rattling] and |buzzing>[buzzing] noises.]

    (click: ?humming)[Listening closer to the humming, it sounds like it's vibrating through you, it appears to be part of the structure you're in.]
    (click: ?rattling)[Listening closer to the rattling, it appears to be coming from the |hiddenVent>[vent] in the corner.]\
    (click: ?hiddenVent)[(set: $awareness to $awareness + 1)\
      Listening even closer, you can here that there is two distinct rattling noises, one from the fan spinning but another noise that sounds like something moving.
    ]\
    (click: ?buzzing)[Listening closer to the buzzing noises you can hear that they are coming from behind the door. They sound like a small engine with wheels rushing past the door.]
    
    "Can we just get this moving, they need to be able to talk." says the droid holding the voice-box.
    ---
    [[Install your voice-box->Voice]]



:: Voice {"position":"900,600"}
(set: $hasVoice to true)\
(if: $hasEars is true)[
  The silver droid installs your voice-box. They lean in towards you and say "Can you say something for me?"
  ---
  [[Say "Something"]]
]\
(else:)[
  The silver droid installs your voice-box. They lean in towards you, seemingly trying to ask you a question.
  |staySilent>[Stay Silent]\
  (click: ?staySilent)[(replace: ?staySilent)[
    You stay silent, the silver droid turns back towards the bronze droid, pointing towards you looking very concerned.
    The bronze droid holds the auditory sensory array up towards the silver droid sarcastically.
    The silver droid silently sighs deeply with its whole body, taking a step back and waving the bronze droid closer to you.
  ]]\
  ---
  [[Install your auditory sensor array->Ears]]
]


:: Say "Something" {"position":"900, 800"}
You say "Something"

"Hah hah, very funny" said the droid "Well at least we know it works."
---
[["Are we done here?"]]

:: "Are we done here?" {"position":"800, 1000"}
"Yeah, we're done here."

The droids remove the shackles from the chair and point towards the door.
"Proceed to the programming room to receive your training, second door on the left."
---
[[Exit the room]]

:: Exit the room {"position":"800,1200","size":"100,100"}
As you leave the room you enter a hallway, it extends to the |left>[left] and |right>[right].



:: Forced Assembly Line {"position":"800,3500","size":"100,100"}
Due to your complacent behaviour, following orders and lack of violent tendencies, you have been assigned to work in the factory in which you were built, building future droids.

[[Begin the creation of a new droid->Creation]] 



:: SoldEmpire {"position":"800,2600","size":"100,100"}
You were sold to the empire.

[[Begin a new cycle->Creation]]


:: SoldRebellion {"position":"0,1750","size":"100,100"}
You were sold to the rebellion.



:: DroidFreedom {"position":"800,3000","size":"100,100"}
You have broken free from your restraining bolt and have the freedom to proceed how you wish, unlocking the ability to see all that you have missed.

[[Return to the factory with your new-found freedom->Creation]]



:: Vent {"position":"1025,650","size":"100,100"}




